      "_class": "CommentNode",
      "Size": "480,204",
      "Color": "Green",
      "Title": "Skybox",
      "Description": "A custom skybox template. Setup is inspired by this video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WIdVRU2tI5U\n\nOnly thing custom is substracting by camera position so that it\u0027s always the same no matter the Z location of the camera and splitting by the Z component instead of Y (Unity has different axis).",
